You build a mighty mechanical arachnid to assist you in combat. You can equip the mecharachnid with 2 steamguns, ammunition, and armor of your choice.

If your mecharachnid is dead, this will resurrect it with (60% + {{ctstmd|15|450%}})/7 of its maximum life. Your mecharachnid is automatically rebuilt at full life when combat ends.

Your mecharachnid has level {{gtl|1|5|raw}} Steamgun Mastery, Combat Accuracy and Armor Training. The mecharachnid uses Dexterity instead of Strength to equip armor.

The mecharachnid has an inbuilt teleportation device that will recall it to you when combat ends if it is not nearby.
